  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Whisker_seer.png\" title=\"Ice Whisker Seer\"><img alt=\"Ice Whisker Seer\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"235\" src=\"/images/recovered/Whisker_seer.png\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Whisker_seer.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Ice Whisker Seer</div></div></div>\n<p>Levitating casters of the Whiskers race, these mages are slightly less vulnerable than their shaman brethren.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Whisker\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Mage\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Whisker Seer\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Karnage's Lot</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Embercore Seer\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Seer\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Specials</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Sinistrad\" title=\"Ancient Sinistrad\">Ancient Sinistrads</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Aged_Lorgalis\" title=\"Aged Lorgalis\">Aged Lorgalis</a> are Champions found in <a href=\"/wiki/Karnage's_Lot\" title=\"Karnage's Lot\">Karnage's Lot</a>.\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Seer\" title=\"The Seer\">The Seer</a> is the final Hero in <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Maximum Security Kremlin</a>.  When he is destroyed the Boss gates open and <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin\" title=\"Ratsputin\">Ratsputin</a> emerges to attack.\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Unique\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Unique</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim\" title=\"Vergrim\">Vergrim</a>, Boss of <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a> is a very large and powerful Divine Whisker Seer.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
